he train's parts, doors to unlock, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Semi-realistic stylized graphics</strong> and characters driven by a B-movie style story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chilling and exciting <strong>adaptive soundtrack</strong>!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132890/extras/3a4cec9347daaa48d7a8f696191148ca.avif?t=1788272552\" width=900 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>", "short_description": "Fight through a train overtaken by monsters and survive Antarctica’s cold as paranormal special agent Doug Barker in this chilling single-player third-person survival horror roguelite.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Korean, Traditional Chinese, Italian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132890/84f68db912e11261691025f8c5c6dc30c13a6d7c/header.jpg?t=1788272552", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132890/766b26db4e203c44ae833ff5b03e856502e47a95/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788272552", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132890/766b26db4e203c44ae833ff5b03e856502e47a95/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788272552", "website": "https://www.wildartsgames.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6500<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 98